## 권한 없는 계정(agent-test)은 실행할 수 없다

agent-test$ $AGENT_HOME/bin/monitor.sh; echo "exit=$?"
-bash: line 1: /home/agent-admin/agent-app/bin/monitor.sh: Permission denied
exit=126

